# PallyPower.xml and MinimapButton.xml each <Script>-include their own .lua as
# their first line, so listing those .lua files here too would execute them
# twice. The XML is the loader (that's why the pair must stay in one folder) -
# load order is unchanged: ManaCost, then PallyPower.lua+frames, then
# MinimapButton.lua+frames.
PallyPower\PallyPowerManaCost.lua
PallyPower\PallyPower.xml
PallyPower\MinimapButton.xml

